    "title": "Summer Programme announced",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "ISMC announces the details for 2015 Summer Programme.  This year, the two-week course will take Education and Muslim communities as its theme.  Held at ISMC's central-London location, the programme will run from 6-17 July 2015.",
