    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We are delighted to announce the details for our popular Summer Programme. This year, the two-week programme will take Education and Muslim communities as its theme. Held at ISMC's central-London location at 210 Euston Road, the programme will run from 6-17 July 2015 and will be in two parts. Each week can be taken separately and will feature content carefully designed to support and develop professionals and those with an interest in Muslim societies.  Click here to apply online."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Speakers will include"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Derryl Maclean (Simon Fraser University, Vancouver)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Farid Panjwani (Institute of Education)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Shiraz Thobani (Institute of Ismaili Studies)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Stephane Pradines (AKU-ISMC)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Sarah Savant (AKU-ISMC)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Kathryn Spellman Poots (AKU-ISMC)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr David Taylor (AKU-ISMC)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The fee for each of the two weeks is £450. A fee of £800 will be charged for the two week programme. Applications will open from Monday 19 April 2015."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
